of,” 267; murmured against, 305.

Philip, one of the Twelve, 242; preaches in Samaria, 104;
encounters Simon Magus, 105; instructs Ethiopian eunuch, 105; married, 161;
confounded with Philip, the Evangelist, 162, 171; burial-place of, 162;
